  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t🌍 ARGUS DATASET\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMulti-Domain Global Landmark, Streetscape & Geospatial Intelligence Dataset\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t📌 Dataset Overview\n\t\n\nARGUS_DATASET is an open, research-grade geospatial intelligence (GEOINT), computer vision, and visual geolocation benchmark dataset. It provides verified, multi-angle landmark photography, panoramic street-level imagery, spatial index databases, and DCT perceptual hash trees across sovereign nations, territories, and municipalities… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/YTxFSGAMERz/ARGUS_DATASET.",
